WEBVTT

00:13:58.668 --> 00:14:02.004
You think that people think you're smart
when you use them? They don't.

00:14:02.038 --> 00:14:03.873
They just want to throw a shoe at you.

00:14:03.906 --> 00:14:04.941
(Laughter)

00:14:04.941 --> 00:14:08.945
Which leads me to point five,
which is just stop.

00:14:08.945 --> 00:14:11.314
Just stop.

00:14:11.314 --> 00:14:15.051
The greatest gift
that you can give yourself and others

00:14:15.084 --> 00:14:16.719
in this cluttered world

00:14:16.753 --> 00:14:19.522
is their time back and is your time back.

00:14:20.323 --> 00:14:25.728
Use as few words,
as few sentences as humanly possible

00:14:25.762 --> 00:14:28.464
so that that person
gets the message you want

00:14:28.498 --> 00:14:32.735
and you both get the time back
that you deserve.